{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With LightSouls you embark on a first journey into the comprehensive, spiritual \u201ccosmos\u201d of Gor Rassadin. Start your inner transformation and learn how to use Gor's archetypal and powerful cosmograms correctly in this first APP module.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Functions (selection):</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cosmograms</strong>: Learn all about archetypal cosmograms, their respective functions and how they relate to each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844060/extras/463e7791f790de2a9c3e7d71bc523b81.avif?t=1753346371\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Daily card:</strong> Draw one of 21 cards at random every day or choose the card according to your current interests. The kosmogram being that you encounter will give you the right answer to a topic that concerns you with its BEING.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844060/extras/3effd6c90b745c85a0ff4fe5cfd87db8.avif?t=1753346371\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Combinations</strong>: You can combine several cards to create a powerful combination that will help you in specific life situations. Or select a specific topic directly and find out which combination you can use for what.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844060/extras/e4e86822b87d79170b00a578ad0102f9.avif?t=1753346371\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Controls</strong>: In three meditative videos created exclusively for this application, you will learn how to control reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844060/extras/a22ca8e2edd8cd5cecd4c1b0a6a2a07b.avif?t=1753346371\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Interactions</strong>: Interact and experience eight 3D models and cosmogram mandalas, some of them animated and developed from scratch for this app.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844060/extras/d440edfae35f67ba91057f8427d4f52e.avif?t=1753346371\" /></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Panoptikum</strong>:\u00a0Visit the huge, virtual and interactive exhibition space and experience various exhibits accompanied by music, animations and fascinating computer art based on the powerful 3D cosmograms.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844060/extras/a9a56db3715519d42a41bdabb0bbf9d5.avif?t=1753346371\" /></div></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3844060?t=1753346371","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844060/d2cdd02de14e61528b95f69092502c5258a2949e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753346371","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844060/852f3b471d48541c449adfe9bf985dc704f29245/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753346371","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844060/852f3b471d48541c449adfe9bf985dc704f29245/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753346371","categories":[{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":